tai","label":{"zh":"三仙台","en":"Sanxiantai"},"lat":23.12477,"lon":121.41652,"h":77,"side":"R","t":232.16,"dist":5135,"tt":2148,"src":[7]},"greenisland":{"zh":"綠島","en":"Green Island","label":{"zh":"綠島","en":"Green Island"},"lat":22.66667,"lon":121.48306,"h":0,"side":"L","t":258.86,"dist":26644,"tt":2466,"src":[8]}},"shots":[{"t0":0.0,"dur":4.0,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":4.0,"dur":19.5,"zh":["台北松山機場起飛；右側是台北 101，高 508 公尺。","2004 年完工的台北 101，曾是世界最高的建築。","這趟模擬航線沿著東海岸，往南飛向台東。"],"en":["Taking off from Taipei Songshan; on the right, Taipei 101, 508 m tall.","Completed in 2004, Taipei 101 was once the world's tallest building.","This simulated route follows the east coast south to Taitung."]},{"t0":23.5,"dur":40.48,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":63.98,"dur":13.0,"zh":["右側是龜山島，頭城外海約十公里的火山島。","最高點海拔 398 公尺；海底的熱泉說明火山仍在活動。"],"en":["On the right: Guishan Island, a volcanic island about 10 km off the Toucheng coast.","It peaks at 398 m, and hot vents on the seabed show the volcano is still active."],"poi":"guishan"},{"t0":76.98,"dur":45.72,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":122.71,"dur":13.0,"zh":["右側是清水斷崖，綿延約 21 公里。","崖壁平均高約 800 公尺，後方的清水山海拔 2,408 公尺。"],"en":["On the right: the Qingshui Cliff, running for about 21 km.","It averages some 800 m high; Qingshui Mountain behind it reaches 2,408 m."],"poi":"qingshui"},{"t0":135.71,"dur":10.31,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":146.02,"dur":13.0,"zh":["立霧溪在這裡入海，上游就是太魯閣峽谷。","太魯閣國家公園 1986 年成立，面積約 9.2 萬公頃。"],"en":["Here the Liwu River meets the sea; upstream lies Taroko Gorge.","Taroko National Park was set up in 1986 and covers about 92,000 hectares."],"poi":"liwu"},{"t0":159.02,"dur":67.29,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":226.31,"dur":13.0,"zh":["右側是三仙台，八座拱連成的步橋，連接岬角與小島。","步橋全長近四百公尺，1987 年完工。"],"en":["On the right: Sanxiantai, where an eight-arch footbridge links the headland to an island.","Nearly 400 m long, the bridge was completed in 1987."],"poi":"sanxiantai"},{"t0":239.31,"dur":13.7,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":253.01,"dur":13.0,"zh":["左側是綠島，距台灣東岸約 33 公里。","島上的朝日溫泉是海水溫泉，水溫約攝氏 53 度。"],"en":["On the left: Green Island, about 33 km off Taiwan's east coast.","Its Zhaori hot spring is seawater heated to about 53 °C."],"poi":"greenisland"},{"t0":266.01,"dur":17.99,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":284.0,"dur":6.5,"zh":["降落台東豐年機場。"],"en":["Landing at Taitung Fengnian Airport."]},{"t0":290.5,"dur":9.5,"zh":[],"en":[]}],"log":[{"t":0.0,"tt":0,"kind":"dep","zh":"起飛：臺北松山機場","en":"Takeoff: Taipei Songshan Airport"},{"t":14.44,"tt":43,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 3 公里：台北 101","en":"Taipei 101, 3 km right","k":"t101"},{"t":69.83,"tt":522,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 5 公里：龜山島","en":"Guishan Island, 5 km right","k":"guishan"},{"t":75.55,"tt":558,"kind":"toc","zh":"爬升至巡航高度 12,000 呎","en":"Top of climb, 12,000 ft"},{"t":128.56,"tt":1161,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 10 公里：清水斷崖","en":"Qingshui Cliff, 10 km right","k":"qingshui"},{"t":151.87,"tt":1233,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 11 公里：太魯閣","en":"Taroko, 11 km right","k":"liwu"},{"t":213.16,"tt":1952,"kind":"tod","zh":"開始下降","en":"Top of descent"},{"t":232.16,"tt":2148,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 5 公里：三仙台","en":"Sanxiantai, 5 km right","k":"sanxiantai"},{"t":258.86,"tt":2466,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 27 公里：綠島","en":"Green Island, 27 km left","k":"greenisland"},{"t":300.0,"tt":2880,"kind":"arr","zh":"降落：臺東豐年機場","en":"Landing: Taitung Fengnian Airport"}],"note":{"zh":"模擬畫面：航路取兩機場間的大圓航線，高度、速度與時間依一般客機爬升下降推算，並非實際航班紀錄；大部分雲層已移除。","en":"Simulation: a great-circle path between the airports, with height, speed and times estimated from typical airliner climbs and descents. Not a real flight record; most clouds are removed."},"geo_src":"great circle between the airports via set points","sources":[{"title":"OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), route geometry","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Taipei 101","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taipei_101"},{"title":"東北角及宜蘭海岸國家風景區觀光資訊網－深度探索：地質","url":"https://www.necoast-nsa.gov.tw/Articles.aspx?a=109&l=1"},{"title":"東北角及宜蘭海岸國家風景區觀光資訊網－龜山島","url":"https://www.necoast-nsa.gov.tw/Attraction-Con